      {
        "title": "Hand Over Machine",
        "body": "Forty-two hours of hand-stitching per piece. Half-canvas chest construction. Working surgeon cuffs. Pick-stitched lapels. The shortcuts that make modern suits cheap are the shortcuts we refuse."
      },
      {
        "title": "For a Lifetime",
        "body": "Every YES garment includes lifetime alterations. As your body changes, the suit follows. As fashion turns, the cut endures. We are not in the business of disposable elegance."
